More secure environments


=======================================
1. Security
Runner has direct access to server
Be careful:
Limit who can trigger pipelines
Use protected branches

2. Tag Control (Very Important)
Tags ensure:
Job goes to correct server
Without tags → wrong server might pick job

3. Scaling
Multiple servers = multiple runners
Each server = its own execution node

4.✅ When to Use This Approach

Use Runner-on-server when:

🔐 No inbound SSH allowed
🏢 Strict on-prem firewall
🔄 Want agent-like behavior (like Nolio)
⚡ Need local execution

You have many dynamic environments (hard to manage runners)

Flow:

Deployment triggered → Agent checks → Pulls package → Deploys


